{"unit_id":"say007go__dsh-imagegen#card-zh","repo":"say007go/dsh-imagegen","commit":"9197dd460e5a86f2000dc607575e8741361188ca","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-imagegen 是一款面向 DSH Web 的图像生成插件，通过 image_generate 工具连接可配置的 OpenAI 兼容生图接口。它支持文字生成图片，以及使用 URL、本地文件或对话附件作为参考图进行图生图；可选择同步或异步任务协议，允许继续等待已有任务。插件还能自动追加提示词后缀、设置默认或单次图片尺寸，并将结果保存到会话目录或指定路径。适合需要在 DSH 对话中生成和编辑图片的用户。使用时需配置生图 API Key；本地参考图走 image-array 模式时还需腾讯云 COS 凭证。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:199-235","lib/index.js:339-401","lib/protocol.js:210-253"]}
{"unit_id":"say007go__dsh-imagegen#card-en","repo":"say007go/dsh-imagegen","commit":"9197dd460e5a86f2000dc607575e8741361188ca","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-imagegen connects DSH Web to an OpenAI-compatible image service for text-to-image and image-to-image. It accepts URL, file, or attachment references, resumes tasks, adds prompt suffixes, sets sizes, and saves images. It needs an API key; local references in image-array mode need Tencent COS.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:199-235","lib/index.js:339-401","lib/protocol.js:210-253"]}
