{"unit_id":"say007go__dsh-imagegen#feature-text-to-image","repo":"say007go/dsh-imagegen","commit":"9197dd460e5a86f2000dc607575e8741361188ca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-imagegen 的功能「文字生成图片」：通过 image_generate 提交提示词、模型与尺寸到配置的生图服务，并把返回图片保存到本地。支持同步响应和异步任务等待。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:199-210","lib/protocol.js:210-253"]}
{"unit_id":"say007go__dsh-imagegen#feature-image-reference","repo":"say007go/dsh-imagegen","commit":"9197dd460e5a86f2000dc607575e8741361188ca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-imagegen 的功能「参考图生成」：可把 URL、本地图片或对话附件作为参考图；本地图片会处理后按配置走 COS 上传，或在 multipart 模式直接传文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:339-390","lib/protocol.js:163-204"]}
{"unit_id":"say007go__dsh-imagegen#feature-resume-task","repo":"say007go/dsh-imagegen","commit":"9197dd460e5a86f2000dc607575e8741361188ca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-imagegen 的功能「续等生成任务」：传入已有 task_id 后继续轮询该任务，不会再次提交生成请求；任务超时信息会保留任务 ID 供后续续等。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:305-329","lib/protocol.js:97-160","lib/protocol.js:210-213"]}
{"unit_id":"say007go__dsh-imagegen#feature-save-result","repo":"say007go/dsh-imagegen","commit":"9197dd460e5a86f2000dc607575e8741361188ca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-imagegen 的功能「保存生成结果」：将 base64 图片或服务返回图片链接对应的文件保存到会话目录 images/，也可指定 save_path；目标已存在时会报错而不覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:113-164"]}
{"unit_id":"say007go__dsh-imagegen#caveat-cos-upload","repo":"say007go/dsh-imagegen","commit":"9197dd460e5a86f2000dc607575e8741361188ca","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-imagegen 使用前须知：image-array 模式下，本地参考图会压缩后上传至腾讯云 COS，并以签名 URL 供生图服务读取；URL 参考图不走 COS。（见 lib/index.js:166-196、351-369）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:166-196","lib/index.js:351-369"]}
